This project is built with Qwen2.5-Coder-3B-Instruct and distributes a
fine-tuned, partially merged Q4_K_M derivative of the upstream instruction
model.

Qwen is licensed under the Qwen RESEARCH LICENSE AGREEMENT,
Copyright (c) Alibaba Cloud. All Rights Reserved.

The derivative adds English/Kiswahili coding-tutor behavior and natural
English-Kiswahili code-switching. It is described as "Built with Qwen" as
required by the upstream license. The submitted model runs directly through
llama.cpp without a translation model or cloud dependency.

